Ledger and Ledlight produce the same valuation selection balances.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts 'Assets:*' --denominate

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager --sort account --exchange USD balance --flat --no-total --format '%20(display_total)  %(account)\n' '^Assets:'

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD

commodity FUND
  format 1000 FUND
commodity NOK
  format 1,000.00 NOK
commodity GBP
  format 1,000.00 GBP
commodity BOND
  format 1000 BOND
account Assets:Investments
account Assets:Bonds
account Equity:Opening

P 2023-12-31 GBP 1.25 USD
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 USD
P 2024-01-01 BOND 8 GBP
P 2024-02-01 FUND 2 NOK
P 2024-02-01 BOND 2 NOK

2024-03-01 Hold fund units
  Assets:Investments  3 FUND {10 USD}
  Equity:Opening  -30 USD

2024-03-01 Hold bond units
  Assets:Bonds  2 BOND {10 USD}
  Equity:Opening  -20 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

           20.00 USD  Assets:Bonds
           30.00 USD  Assets:Investments
